 still get  the same exact chip in the new iPad so  in my honest opinion do not buy the 2019  iPad for just 56 dollars more you can  get the iPad Mini 5 on Amazon  with free prime shipping that iPad comes  with a powerful 8:12 Bionic chip in a  much better display and if you want a  larger size you can get the 2019 iPad  air for just four hundred and sixty nine  dollars and trust me it's many times  better in every way  now what if you don't want to spend  three hundred and eighty-five dollars on  an iPad well to be completely honest  you'll be better off just getting the  2018 iPad brand-new for only two hundred  and fifty dollars on Amazon and you  should order it quickly because trust me  it's gonna sell out really fast well  link that down in the description below  you'll save $80 and you don't have to  wait until the end of the month for it  to be released now I do want to mention  the only reason why I would buy the 2019  iPad instead Apple's TV plus  subscription service is coming out on  November 1st and Apple mentioned that if  you buy a new Apple device you'll get  one year of streaming for free  that's a $60 value which brings the  price of the new iPad down to two  hundred and sixty nine dollars which I  would say is actually worth it for $20  more than the $250 2018 iPad however  that deal also applies to the new 2019  iPads as well making them an even better  deal if you buy them from Apple but  beware if you're already planning on  buying something like the new iPhone 11  the Apple TV Plus deal doesn't stack so  you'll still only get one year for free  either way we're still ordering the 10.2  inch iPad to make comparison videos and  see if anything else has changed so if  you're not already subscribed click that  circle above and check out our videos on  the iPhone 11 pro and Apple watch series  5 right there  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next video  [Music]
 

